    <string name="help_text">Point the port at your own copy of the game: no game files are bundled and nothing is uploaded.\n\nGame files\nOn Steam: right-click %1$s → Manage → Browse local files. Copy the %2$s/ folder from %3$s to the phone, then pick the folder that holds it. Only %2$s/ is read; the rest of the install is the desktop NW.js runtime, not needed.\n\nSaves\nOn the computer they are in:\n%4$s\nCopy the save folder itself into the saves folder you picked here (this card\'s ⋮ → Select save folder), or just its contents — the port reads either shape (the game\'s own %5$s/ subfolder, or the files at the top level).\nNot there? Search your computer for %6$s.</string>
